input devices enumerate (power key, gpio keys, touchkeys, maXTouch), eMMC and
partitions enumerate. This is driver registration, not visual/touch-event
validation or SD-card/OS boot proof. CPU DT count warning remains expected
with two DT CPUs and this UP kernel.

